1017:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** /**
1018:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  * @brief  Core function for the Q15 CIFFT butterfly process.
1019:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  * @param[in, out] *pSrc16          points to the in-place buffer of Q15 data type.
1020:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  * @param[in]      fftLen           length of the FFT.
1021:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  * @param[in]      *pCoef16         points to twiddle coefficient buffer.
1022:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  * @param[in]      twidCoefModifier twiddle coefficient modifier that supports different size FFTs 
1023:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  * @return none.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lamp\AppData\Local\Temp\ccPJxx19.s 			page 46


1024:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c ****  */
1025:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** 
1026:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** /*
1027:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * Radix-4 IFFT algorithm used is :
1028:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1029:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * CIFFT uses same twiddle coefficients as CFFT function
1030:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *  x[k] = x[n] + (j)k * x[n + fftLen/4] + (-1)k * x[n+fftLen/2] + (-j)k * x[n+3*fftLen/4]
1031:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1032:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1033:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * IFFT is implemented with following changes in equations from FFT
1034:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1035:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * Input real and imaginary data:
1036:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(n) = xa + j * ya
1037:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(n+N/4 ) = xb + j * yb
1038:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(n+N/2 ) = xc + j * yc
1039:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(n+3N 4) = xd + j * yd
1040:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1041:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1042:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * Output real and imaginary data:
1043:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(4r) = xa'+ j * ya'
1044:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(4r+1) = xb'+ j * yb'
1045:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(4r+2) = xc'+ j * yc'
1046:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * x(4r+3) = xd'+ j * yd'
1047:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1048:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1049:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * Twiddle factors for radix-4 IFFT:
1050:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * Wn = co1 + j * (si1)
1051:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * W2n = co2 + j * (si2)
1052:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * W3n = co3 + j * (si3)
1053:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** 
1054:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * The real and imaginary output values for the radix-4 butterfly are
1055:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * xa' = xa + xb + xc + xd
1056:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * ya' = ya + yb + yc + yd
1057:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * xb' = (xa-yb-xc+yd)* co1 - (ya+xb-yc-xd)* (si1)
1058:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * yb' = (ya+xb-yc-xd)* co1 + (xa-yb-xc+yd)* (si1)
1059:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * xc' = (xa-xb+xc-xd)* co2 - (ya-yb+yc-yd)* (si2)
1060:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * yc' = (ya-yb+yc-yd)* co2 + (xa-xb+xc-xd)* (si2)
1061:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * xd' = (xa+yb-xc-yd)* co3 - (ya-xb-yc+xd)* (si3)
1062:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** * yd' = (ya-xb-yc+xd)* co3 + (xa+yb-xc-yd)* (si3)
1063:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** *
1064:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** */
1065:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_cfft_radix4_q15.c **** 
